      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تعكّف</span></b>  <i>He confined, restrained, withheld,</i> or

<i>debarred, himself;</i> (O, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اعتكف</span></b> : one
should not say ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انعكف</span></b> . (K.)

